{"id":"n57271-1-7","stage":1,"title":"싫다 · 讨厌","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57271-1-7-1","ko":"너는 왜 지수랑은 이야기도 안 해?","zh":"你为什么都不和智秀说话啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"지수랑은","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지수랑은","audio":"/audio/d9d3d5ce54ec4ce4e630.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수랑은","audio":"/audio/d9d3d5ce54ec4ce4e630.mp3"}},{"text":"이야기도","meaning":"聊天，说话","explanation":"이야기：聊天，说话；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"이야기","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60321","senseId":"2","lemma":"이야기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이야기도","audio":"/audio/891ca06b63b4cae7266f.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"해?","meaning":"说话、聊天","explanation":"이야기도 안 해? 表示“连话都不说吗”；하다 与 이야기 连用为“说话”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"28","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}}